1) Score file
I'm not quite sure what the desired way to write to the score file is.
On H 1.0.3, it would only write one score (the best) for each name
and character-type combo.
On an earlier version of PC NH 3.0 that I had, it would do this *most* of
the time.  Occasionnally it would let an extra Jon-S or whatever slip by.
On the version I ftp'ed from lampwick, it creates a new entry every time I
play.  Is it supposed to do that?  Do we want it to do that?

2) "Clairvoyance"
